        {
          "text": "HUI Shih-ch'i 惠士奇 (T. 天牧, 仲孺, H. 半農, 紅豆主人), 1671–1741, scholar, was a native of Yüan-ho (Soochow). His grandfather, Hui Yu-shêng 惠有聲 (T. 律和, H. 樸庵, d. about 1678, aged 70 sui), was a teacher of the Classics in Wu-hsien (Soochow).",
